1 Lorraine, Wandering Warrior
1 Clarent, Sword of Peace
1 Backup Charger
1 Purifying Thurible
# Main
4 Escharotomy
4 Dungeon Guide
4 Fairy Whispers
4 Fluffy Shopkeep
4 Windslice
4 Windslice
4 Windslice
4 Windslice
4 Windslice
DECK,
