1 Spirit of Water
1 Mordred, Burnished Avenger
1 Mordred, Flawless Blade
1 Mordred, Fated Luminary
1 Mordred, Aurelian Regent
1 Mirrordepth's Blade
1 Dummy Trainer
1 Rhongomiant, Grove's Spire
# Main
9 Dungeon Guide
9 Fluffy Shopkeep
DECK;

